{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verbs"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10SyntaxRuleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SyntaxRule"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"verbs","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"GnustoConversation"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:18GnustoConversation0B0V5verbsSay0A010SyntaxRuleVGvp"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verbs"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10SyntaxRuleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SyntaxRule","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SyntaxRule"},{"kind":"text","text":"] { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No greeting row any more. This block used to carry bare "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hello"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hi"},{"type":"text","text":", on the grounds that the engine left them to a conversation system;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the engine ships them now (#445), and every spelling of a greeting —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bare, with an object, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"say hello to <object>"},{"type":"text","text":" — is a built-in row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaching "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Intent.greet"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"talk"},{"type":"text","text":" is not here because it is the engine’s: "},{"type